window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-027-615772154df28f7b.json"]={sha256:"615772154df28f7bf2a0179b3561585a3eef502abafc58e62fec448792586cdb",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-b7a337ca69ad5153","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux/Layer-3/Routing/Equal-Cost-Multipath-Load-Sharing/","title":"Equal Cost Multipath Load Sharing","titleEn":"Equal Cost Multipath Load Sharing","publisher":"NVIDIA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-027","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-027","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-028","referenceUrls":["https://docs.kernel.org/networking/bonding.html"],"title":"Linux bonding：故障偵測延遲與黑洞暴露","titleEn":"Linux bonding: detection delay and blackhole exposure","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付每流指派、每路徑帳本、總容量反證與路徑失效的替代假說；不得把模型當自動路由調參器；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver per-flow assignments, path ledgers, the aggregate-capacity counterexample and the failed-path alternative hypothesis. This is an offline audit, not an automatic routing-tuning tool. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"時間線分故障發生、偵測、切換、可用恢復；把載波訊號與探測回應列成不同觀察。","differenceEn":"Build a timeline with failure onset, detection, switching and restored usability. Record carrier signals separately from probe responses so the evidence describes which failure class the monitor can actually observe.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["最忙路徑利用比為該路徑需求率除以容量；流不可分割時，平均流量不能替代實際指派後的最大值；六條流各 8 GB/s，兩條路徑各容量 20 GB/s；名義分配 5:1，變更 3:3；名義式 5*8/20 = 2 load/capacity；變更式 3*8/20 = 1.2 load/capacity。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","固定供給且完全黑洞的模型中，暴露封包量為封包率乘偵測延遲；此量不等於最終不可恢復的應用資料；供給率每秒 2000 包；偵測延遲名義 0.3 秒、變更 0.05 秒；切換後立即恢復是教學假設；名義式 2000*0.3 = 600 packets exposed；變更式 2000*0.05 = 100 packets exposed。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Busiest-path load ratio divides its offered rate by capacity. When flows are indivisible, average offered traffic cannot replace the maximum load after actual assignment. Use six flows of 8 GB/s and two paths of 20 GB/s each. Assignment changes from five flows versus one to three versus three; offered total remains 48 GB/s. Nominal 5*8/20 = 2 load/capacity; changed 3*8/20 = 1.2 load/capacity. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Under constant offered rate and a complete blackhole, exposed packets equal packet rate times detection delay. This is not necessarily permanently lost application data because retries and transport recovery are separate. Offer 2000 packets per second. Detection delay changes from 0.3 to 0.05 seconds, with immediate recovery after detection assumed for the fixture rather than asserted for real bonding behavior. Nominal 2000*0.3 = 600 packets exposed; changed 2000*0.05 = 100 packets exposed. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-037","referenceUrls":["https://docs.ceph.com/en/latest/rados/operations/erasure-code/"],"title":"Ceph EC：小更新的完整條帶重寫模型","titleEn":"Ceph EC: a full-stripe rewrite model for small updates","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付每流指派、每路徑帳本、總容量反證與路徑失效的替代假說；不得把模型當自動路由調參器；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver per-flow assignments, path ledgers, the aggregate-capacity counterexample and the failed-path alternative hypothesis. This is an offline audit, not an automatic routing-tuning tool. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"帳本分 useful_write、old_data_read、encoded_write；每項附採用策略，避免將奇偶校驗容量直接當實際 read-modify-write 次數。","differenceEn":"Separate useful writes, old-data reads and encoded writes in the ledger. Attach the assumed strategy to every term so parity capacity is not mistaken for a measured read-modify-write operation count.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["最忙路徑利用比為該路徑需求率除以容量；流不可分割時，平均流量不能替代實際指派後的最大值；六條流各 8 GB/s，兩條路徑各容量 20 GB/s；名義分配 5:1，變更 3:3；名義式 5*8/20 = 2 load/capacity；變更式 3*8/20 = 1.2 load/capacity。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","模型選擇 k=4、m=2，每 shard 1 MiB；小更新先讀四資料 shard 再寫六 shard，放大量為總模型 I/O 除有用更新量；名義只改 64 KiB，完整讀 4 MiB 寫 6 MiB；變更提供完整 4 MiB 新條帶，只寫 6 MiB；名義式 (4+6)*1024/64 = 160 modeled I/O amplification；變更式 6/4 = 1.5 modeled I/O amplification。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Busiest-path load ratio divides its offered rate by capacity. When flows are indivisible, average offered traffic cannot replace the maximum load after actual assignment. Use six flows of 8 GB/s and two paths of 20 GB/s each. Assignment changes from five flows versus one to three versus three; offered total remains 48 GB/s. Nominal 5*8/20 = 2 load/capacity; changed 3*8/20 = 1.2 load/capacity. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Choose k=4, m=2 and 1 MiB shards. The specified small-update strategy reads four data shards and writes six shards; amplification divides modeled read-plus-write bytes by useful update bytes. Nominally update 64 KiB while reading 4 MiB and writing 6 MiB. In the changed case provide the full new 4 MiB stripe and write 6 MiB without reading old data. Nominal (4+6)*1024/64 = 160 modeled I/O amplification; changed 6/4 = 1.5 modeled I/O amplification. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-09b7a0c58148145b","url":"https://docs.kernel.org/networking/bonding.html","title":"Linux Ethernet Bonding Driver HOWTO","titleEn":"Linux Ethernet Bonding Driver HOWTO","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-e22172468bb6c93a","url":"https://docs.ceph.com/en/latest/rados/operations/erasure-code/","title":"Erasure code","titleEn":"Erasure code","publisher":"Ceph project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
